See the [QTranslator](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qtranslator.html) and
[QObject::tr](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qobject.html#tr)() documentation for
more information about contexts, disambiguations and comments.

*n* is used in conjunction with `%n` to support plural forms. See
[QObject::tr](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qobject.html#tr)() for details.

