### `[signal]` void QState::propertiesAssigned()

This signal is emitted when all properties have been assigned their final value. If the
state assigns a value to one or more properties for which an animation exists (either
set on the transition or as a default animation on the state machine), then the signal
will not be emitted until all such animations have finished playing.

