Returns the list of [QStorageInfo](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstorageinfo.html)
objects that corresponds to the list of currently mounted filesystems.

On Windows, this returns the drives visible in the **My Computer** folder. On Unix
operating systems, it returns the list of all mounted filesystems (except for pseudo
filesystems).

